#: includes/class-settings.php:324
msgid "Put a link to your privacy policy here (relative or absolute). Put shortcode [cookieswithease type=\"review\"] and [cookieswithease type=\"reset\"] to your privacy page so visitor can review, update and reset their consent."
msgstr "Ovdje unesite poveznicu na svoju politiku privatnosti (relativnu ili apsolutnu). Dodajte kratke kodove [cookieswithease type=\"review\"] i [cookieswithease type=\"reset\"] na svoju stranicu o privatnosti kako bi posjetitelji mogli pregledati, ažurirati i poništiti svoje privole."

#: includes/class-settings.php:346
msgid "days"
msgstr "dana"

#: includes/class-settings.php:360
msgid "If Must Consent is set to true, Klaro will directly display the consent manager modal and not allow the user to close it before having actively consented or declines the use of third-party apps."
msgstr "Ako je opcija „Obavezno” postavljena na true, Klaro će izravno prikazati prozor upravitelja privola i neće dopustiti korisniku da ga zatvori prije nego što aktivno pristane na korištenje aplikacija trećih strana ili ga odbije."

#: includes/class-settings.php:373
msgid "Hide the cookie graphic shown above the consent banner and modal."
msgstr "Sakrij grafiku kolačića prikazanu iznad bannera i prozora za privolu."

#: includes/class-settings.php:383
msgid "Light"
msgstr "Svijetla"

#: includes/class-settings.php:387
msgid "Dark"
msgstr "Tamna"

#: includes/class-settings.php:391
msgid "Dark Blue"
msgstr "Tamnoplava"

#: includes/class-settings.php:408
msgid "Pick a built-in color scheme for the consent banner, or leave it on Light and override the colors yourself with custom CSS."
msgstr "Odaberite ugrađenu shemu boja za banner za privolu ili ostavite Svijetlu i sami nadjačajte boje vlastitim CSS-om."

#: includes/class-settings.php:418
msgid "Automatically gate YouTube and Vimeo videos embedded via the block editor (URL paste or the embed block) behind consent, without editing each page by hand. Requires a published \"youtube\"/\"vimeo\" Application (see the draft templates created on activation) - the video only loads once the visitor consents to it."
msgstr "Automatski štiti YouTube i Vimeo videozapise ugrađene putem uređivača blokova (lijepljenje URL-a ili blok za ugrađivanje) dok se ne dobije privola, bez potrebe za ručnim uređivanjem svake stranice. Zahtijeva objavljenu aplikaciju \"youtube\"/\"vimeo\" (pogledajte predloške nacrta izrađene prilikom aktivacije) - videozapis se učitava tek nakon što posjetitelj da privolu."

#: includes/class-shortcodes.php:22
msgid "Review and update"
msgstr "Pregledaj i ažuriraj"

#: includes/class-shortcodes.php:26
msgid "Reset your consents"
msgstr "Poništi privole"

#: includes/default-applications.php:20
msgid "Google Analytics is a web analytics service offered by Google that tracks and reports website traffic."
msgstr "Google Analytics je usluga web-analitike tvrtke Google koja prati promet web-stranice i izvještava o njemu."

#: includes/default-applications.php:26
msgid "Google Tag Manager is a tag management system that loads other marketing and analytics scripts on your behalf."
msgstr "Google Tag Manager je sustav za upravljanje oznakama koji umjesto vas učitava druge marketinške i analitičke skripte."

#: includes/default-applications.php:32
msgid "Facebook Pixel is an analytics tool that measures the effectiveness of advertising by understanding the actions visitors take on your website."
msgstr "Facebook Pixel je analitički alat koji mjeri učinkovitost oglašavanja na temelju radnji koje posjetitelji poduzimaju na vašoj web-stranici."

#: includes/default-applications.php:38
msgid "Embedded YouTube videos can set cookies and load third-party scripts from Google once played."
msgstr "Ugrađeni YouTube videozapisi mogu postaviti kolačiće i učitati skripte trećih strana tvrtke Google nakon reprodukcije."

#: includes/default-applications.php:49
msgid "Embedded Google Maps can set cookies and load third-party scripts from Google."
msgstr "Ugrađene Google karte mogu postaviti kolačiće i učitati skripte trećih strana tvrtke Google."

#: includes/default-applications.php:55
msgid "Embedded Vimeo videos can set cookies and load third-party scripts once played."
msgstr "Ugrađeni Vimeo videozapisi mogu postaviti kolačiće i učitati skripte trećih strana nakon reprodukcije."

